\\"offerCount\\\": 1, \\\"availability\\\": \\\"https://schema.org/InStock\\\", \\\"seller\\\": {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"Organization\\\", \\\"name\\\": \\\"Brightluxx\\\", \\\"url\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com\\\", \\\"logo\\\": \\\"https://files.ihgbrands.com/uploads_hero_banner.webp\\\"}, \\\"url\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com/products/immersawall-360\\\"}, \\\"additionalProperty\\\": [{\\\"@type\\\": \\\"PropertyValue\\\", \\\"name\\\": \\\"Pixel Pitch\\\", \\\"value\\\": \\\"2.5mm\\\"}, {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"PropertyValue\\\", \\\"name\\\": \\\"Brightness\\\", \\\"value\\\": \\\"1200 nits\\\"}, {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"PropertyValue\\\", \\\"name\\\": \\\"Warranty\\\", \\\"value\\\": \\\"3 Years Standard | 5 Years Extended Available\\\"}]}14:Tbb0,{\\\"@context\\\": \\\"https://schema.org\\\", \\\"@type\\\": \\\"FAQPage\\\", \\\"mainEntity\\\": [{\\\"@type\\\": \\\"Question\\\", \\\"name\\\": \\\"What makes the ImmersaWall 360 suitable for immersive art experiences?\\\", \\\"acceptedAnswer\\\": {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"Answer\\\", \\\"text\\\": \\\"The ImmersaWall 360 offers 360\\\\u00b0 coverage with floor, wall, and ceiling panels, enabling fully enclosed digital environments. Its integrated IR Motion and LiDAR sensors allow for interactive, real-time content that responds to visitor movements.\\\"}}, {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"Question\\\", \\\"name\\\": \\\"What is the pixel pitch and brightness of the ImmersaWall 360?\\\", \\\"acceptedAnswer\\\": {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"Answer\\\", \\\"text\\\": \\\"This LED wall system features a fine pixel pitch of 2.5mm for sharp, detailed visuals and a brightness level of 1200 nits, ensuring vivid imagery even in well-lit environments.\\\"}}, {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"Question\\\", \\\"name\\\": \\\"How is the ImmersaWall 360 installed and what are its weight considerations?\\\", \\\"acceptedAnswer\\\": {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"Answer\\\", \\\"text\\\": \\\"The modular panels are designed for flexible installation on floors, walls, and ceilings, supporting custom configurations. The system weighs 22kg per square meter, which should be considered for structural support during installation.\\\"}}, {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"Question\\\", \\\"name\\\": \\\"What is the warranty and maintenance support for the ImmersaWall 360?\\\", \\\"acceptedAnswer\\\": {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"Answer\\\", \\\"text\\\": \\\"Brightluxx provides a comprehensive warranty that typically covers parts and labor for one year, with optional extended support plans. Regular maintenance ensures optimal sensor calibration and LED performance.\\\"}}, {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"Question\\\", \\\"name\\\": \\\"How does the ImmersaWall 360 compare to traditional flat LED walls?\\\", \\\"acceptedAnswer\\\": {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"Answer\\\", \\\"text\\\": \\\"Unlike traditional flat LED walls, the ImmersaWall 360 offers immersive 360-degree coverage including floors and ceilings, creating an enveloping digital space. Its built-in motion sensors facilitate interactive experiences unmatched by standard LED displays.\\\"}}, {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"Question\\\", \\\"name\\\": \\\"Is the ImmersaWall 360 suitable for outdoor installations?\\\", \\\"acceptedAnswer\\\": {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"Answer\\\", \\\"text\\\": \\\"While floor panels have an IP54 rating making them resistant to dust and splashes, the system is primarily designed for controlled indoor environments such as museums and branded experience centers.\\\"}}, {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"Question\\\", \\\"name\\\": \\\"What types of venues benefit most from the ImmersaWall 360?\\\", \\\"acceptedAnswer\\\": {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"Answer\\\", \\\"text\\\": \\\"This product is ideal for immersive museums, theme parks, and brand experience centers where interactive and enveloping digital environments significantly enhance visitor engagement.\\\"}}, {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"Question\\\", \\\"name\\\": \\\"How customizable is the content displayed on the ImmersaWall 360?\\\", \\\"acceptedAnswer\\\": {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"Answer\\\", \\\"text\\\": \\\"The system supports real-time content generation that can be customized to react dynamically to visitors via integrated sensors, allowing unique interactive experiences tailored to each installation.\\\"}}]}9:[\\\"$\\\",\\\"main\\\",null,{\\\"data-testid\\\":\\\"next-server-rendered-parity-page\\\",\\\"children\\\":[[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"script\\\",\\\"0\\\",{\\\"type\\\":\\\"application/ld+json\\\",\\\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\\\":{\\\"__html\\\":\\\"$13\\\"}}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"script\\\",\\\"1\\\",{\\\"type\\\":\\\"application/ld+json\\\",\\\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\\\":{\\\"__html\\\":\\\"$14\\\"}}],\\\"$L15\\\",\\\"$L16\\\",\\\"$L17\\\"],\\\"$L18\\\"]}]\\n15:[\\\"$\\\",\\\"script\\\",\\\"2\\\",{\\\"type\\\":\\\"application/ld+json\\\",\\\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\\\":{\\\"__html\\\":\\\"{\\\\\\\"@context\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"https://schema.org\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"@type\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"BreadcrumbList\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"itemListElement\\\\\\\": [{\\\\\\\"@type\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"ListItem\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"position\\\\\\\": 1, \\\\\\\"name\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"Home\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"item\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"https://brightluxx.com\\\\\\\"}, {\\\\\\\"@type\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"ListItem\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"position\\\\\\\": 2, \\\\\\\"name\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"Products\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"item\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"https://brightluxx.com/products\\\\\\\"}, {\\\\\\\"@type\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"ListItem\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"position\\\\\\\": 3, \\\\\\\"name\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"ImmersaWall 360\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"item\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"https://brightluxx.com/products/immersawall-360\\\\\\\"}]}\\\"}}]\\n16:[\\\"$\\\",\\\"script\\\",\\\"3\\\",{\\\"type\\\":\\\"application/ld+json\\\",\\\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\\\":{\\\"__html\\\":\\\"{\\\\\\\"@context\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"https://schema.org\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"@type\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"Organization\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"@id\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"https://brightluxx.com/#organization\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"name\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"Brightluxx\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"legalName\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"Brightluxx LED Displays\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"url\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"https://brightluxx.com\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"logo\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"https://brightluxx.com/android-chrome-512x512.png\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"telephone\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"+971559954274\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"address\\\\\\\": {\\\\\\\"@type\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"PostalAddress\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"streetAddress\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"Jebel Ali Industrial Area 1\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"addressLocality\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"Dubai\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"addressCountry\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"AE\\\\\\\"}, \\\\\\\"contactPoint\\\\\\\": {\\\\\\\"@type\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"ContactPoint\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"telephone\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"+971559954274\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"contactType\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"sales\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"areaServed\\\\\\\": [\\\\\\\"AE\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"SA\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"QA\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"KW\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"BH\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"OM\\\\\\\"], \\\\\\\"availableLanguage\\\\\\\": [\\\\\\\"en\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"ar\\\\\\\"]}}\\\"}}]\\n17:[\\\"$\\\",\\\"script\\\",\\\"4\\\",{\\\"type\\\":\\\"application/ld+json\\\",\\\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\\\":{\\\"__html\\\":\\\"{\\\\\\\"@context\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"https://schema.org\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"@type\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"LocalBusiness\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"@id\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"https://brightluxx.com/#localbusiness\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"name\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"Brightluxx LED Displays\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"image\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"https://brightluxx.com/android-chrome-512x512.png\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"url\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"https://brightluxx.com\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"telephone\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"+971559954274\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"priceRange\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"AED 2,500 - AED 12,000 per m\\\\\\\\u00b2\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"address\\\\\\\": {\\\\\\\"@type\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"PostalAddress\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"streetAddress\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"Jebel Ali Industrial Area 1\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"addressLocality\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"Dubai\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"addressCountry\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"AE\\\\\\\"}, \\\\\\\"geo\\\\\\\": {\\\\\\\"@type\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"GeoCoordinates\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"latitude\\\\\\\": 24.9857, \\\\\\\"longitude\\\\\\\": 55.0272}, \\\\\\\"openingHoursSpecification\\\\\\\": {\\\\\\\"@type\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"OpeningHoursSpecification\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"dayOfWeek\\\\\\\": [\\\\\\\"Monday\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"Tuesday\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"Wednesday\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"Thursday\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"Friday\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"Saturday\\\\\\\"], \\\\\\\"opens\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"09:00\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"closes\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"18:00\\\\\\\"}, \\\\\\\"areaServed\\\\\\\": [\\\\\\\"Dubai\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"Abu Dhabi\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"United Arab Emirates\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"Saudi Arabia\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"Qatar\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"Kuwait\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"Bahrain\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"Oman\\\\\\\"]}\\\"}}]\\n19:T709,\\u003ch1\\u003eImmersaWall 360\\u003c/h1\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eCreate immersive experiences with ImmersaWall 360° LED Displays. Serving Dubai and UAE. Contact Brightluxx for innovative LED walls now!\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003eFloor-to-ceiling immersive LED for teamLab-style experiences.\\u003c/strong\\u003e\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003e360-degree immersive LED wall system designed for interactive museum experiences. Modular panels cover floor, walls, and ceiling to create fully enclosed digital environments. Integrated motion sensors and real-time content generation enable visitor-reactive installations. Used in over 20 immersive art museums worldwide.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003ch2\\u003eFAQ\\u003c/h2\\u003e\\u003ch3\\u003eWhat makes the ImmersaWall 360 suitable for immersive art experiences?\\u003c/h3\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eThe ImmersaWall 360 offers 360° coverage with floor, wall, and ceiling panels, enabling fully enclosed digital environments. Its integrated IR Motion and LiDAR sensors allow for interactive, real-time content that responds to visitor movements.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003ch3\\u003eWhat is the pixel pitch and brightness of the ImmersaWall 360?\\u003c/h3\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eThis LED wall system features a fine pixel pitch of 2.5mm for sharp, detailed visuals and a brightness level of 1200 nits, ensuring vivid imagery even in well-lit environments.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003ch3\\u003eHow is the ImmersaWall 360 installed and what are its weight considerations?\\u003c/h3\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eThe modular panels are designed for flexible installation on floors, walls, and ceilings, supporting custom configurations. The system weighs 22kg per square meter, which should be considered for structural support during installation.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003ch3\\u003eWhat is the warranty and maintenance support for the ImmersaWall 360?\\u003c/h3\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eBrightluxx provides a comprehensive warranty that typically covers parts and labor for one year, with optional extended support plans. Regular maintenance ensures optimal sensor calibration and LED performance.\\u003c/p\\u003e18:[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",null,{\\\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\\\":{\\\"__html\\\":\\\"$19\\\"}}]\\nf:[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"meta\\\",\\\"0\\\",{\\\"charSet\\\":\\\"utf-8\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"meta\\\",\\\"1\\\",{\\\"name\\\":\\\"viewport\\\",\\\"content\\\":\\\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\\\"}]]\\nc:null\\n11:[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"title\\\",\\\"0\\\",{\\\"children\\\":\\\"ImmersaWall 360° LED Display Dubai | Immersive LED Walls | Brightluxx\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"meta\\\",\\\"1\\\",{\\\"name\\\":\\\"description\\\",\\\"content\\\":\\\"Create immersive experiences with ImmersaWall 360° LED Displays. Serving Dubai and UAE. Contact Brightluxx for innovative LED walls now!\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"link\\\",\\\"2\\\",{\\\"rel\\\":\\\"canonical\\\",\\\"href\\\":\\\"https://brightluxx.com/products/immersawall-360\\\"}]]\\n\"])</script></body></html>","rsc":"1:\"$Sreact.fragment\"\n2:I[31262,[\"/_next/static/chunks/36ljooz643x7p.js\"],\"PageViewTracker\"]\n3:I[48303,[\"/_next/static/chunks/36ljooz643x7p.js\"],\"SiteHeader\"]\n4:I[39756,[\"/_next/static/chunks/36ljooz643x7p.js\"],\"default\"]\n5:I[37457,[\"/_next/static/chunks/36ljooz643x7p.js\"],\"default\"]\n6:I[22016,[\"/_next/static/chunks/36ljooz643x7p.js\"],\"