\\\"https://brightluxx.com\\\", \\\"telephone\\\": \\\"+971559954274\\\", \\\"priceRange\\\": \\\"AED 2,500 - AED 12,000 per m\\\\u00b2\\\", \\\"address\\\": {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"PostalAddress\\\", \\\"streetAddress\\\": \\\"Jebel Ali Industrial Area 1\\\", \\\"addressLocality\\\": \\\"Dubai\\\", \\\"addressCountry\\\": \\\"AE\\\"}, \\\"geo\\\": {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"GeoCoordinates\\\", \\\"latitude\\\": 24.9857, \\\"longitude\\\": 55.0272}, \\\"openingHoursSpecification\\\": {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"OpeningHoursSpecification\\\", \\\"dayOfWeek\\\": [\\\"Monday\\\", \\\"Tuesday\\\", \\\"Wednesday\\\", \\\"Thursday\\\", \\\"Friday\\\", \\\"Saturday\\\"], \\\"opens\\\": \\\"09:00\\\", \\\"closes\\\": \\\"18:00\\\"}, \\\"areaServed\\\": [\\\"Dubai\\\", \\\"Abu Dhabi\\\", \\\"United Arab Emirates\\\", \\\"Saudi Arabia\\\", \\\"Qatar\\\", \\\"Kuwait\\\", \\\"Bahrain\\\", \\\"Oman\\\"]}\"}}]\n14:T709,<h1>ImmersaWall 360</h1><p>Create immersive experiences with ImmersaWall 360° LED Displays. Serving Dubai and UAE. Contact Brightluxx for innovative LED walls now!</p><p><strong>Floor-to-ceiling immersive LED for teamLab-style experiences.</strong></p><p>360-degree immersive LED wall system designed for interactive museum experiences. Modular panels cover floor, walls, and ceiling to create fully enclosed digital environments. Integrated motion sensors and real-time content generation enable visitor-reactive installations. Used in over 20 immersive art museums worldwide.</p><h2>FAQ</h2><h3>What makes the ImmersaWall 360 suitable for immersive art experiences?</h3><p>The ImmersaWall 360 offers 360° coverage with floor, wall, and ceiling panels, enabling fully enclosed digital environments. Its integrated IR Motion and LiDAR sensors allow for interactive, real-time content that responds to visitor movements.</p><h3>What is the pixel pitch and brightness of the ImmersaWall 360?</h3><p>This LED wall system features a fine pixel pitch of 2.5mm for sharp, detailed visuals and a brightness level of 1200 nits, ensuring vivid imagery even in well-lit environments.</p><h3>How is the ImmersaWall 360 installed and what are its weight considerations?</h3><p>The modular panels are designed for flexible installation on floors, walls, and ceilings, supporting custom configurations. The system weighs 22kg per square meter, which should be considered for structural support during installation.</p><h3>What is the warranty and maintenance support for the ImmersaWall 360?</h3><p>Brightluxx provides a comprehensive warranty that typically covers parts and labor for one year, with optional extended support plans. Regular maintenance ensures optimal sensor calibration and LED performance.</p>7:[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"$14\"}}]\n8:[\"$\",\"$L15\",null,{\"children\":[\"$\",\"$16\",null,{\"name\":\"Next.MetadataOutlet\",\"children\":\"$@17\"}]}]\nb:[\"$\",\"$1\",\"h\",{\"children\":[null,[\"$\",\"$L18\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"meta\",\"0\",{\"charSet\":\"utf-8\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"1\",{\"name\":\"viewport\",\"content\":\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"hidden\":true,\"children\":[\"$\",\"$L19\",null,{\"children\":[\"$\",\"$16\",null,{\"name\":\"Next.Metadata\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"title\",\"0\",{\"children\":\"ImmersaWall 360° LED Display Dubai | Immersive LED Walls | Brightluxx\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"1\",{\"name\":\"description\",\"content\":\"Create immersive experiences with ImmersaWall 360° LED Displays. Serving Dubai and UAE. Contact Brightluxx for innovative LED walls now!\"}],[\"$\",\"link\",\"2\",{\"rel\":\"canonical\",\"href\":\"https://brightluxx.com/products/immersawall-360\"}]]}]}]}],null]}]\nd:[\"$\",\"$1\",\"c\",{\"children\":[null,[\"$\",\"$L1a\",null,{\"parallelRouterKey\":\"children\",\"template\":[\"$\",\"$L1b\",null,{}]}]]}]\n10:[\"$\",\"$1\",\"c\",{\"children\":[[[\"$\",\"link\",\"0\",{\"rel\":\"stylesheet\",\"href\":\"/_next/static/chunks/37aunjb6qe2jr.css\",\"precedence\"